      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>If the year is born in Gemini, then the rains will be abundant.</li>\n<li>The north wind will rise and strike the late crops [...].</li>\n<li>Produce will be abundant. The Nile's flood will be complete. Death will befall the cattle, and</li>\n<li>itching will af[fl]ict the people. The Byzantines will set sail and their ships will be wrecked.</li>\n<li>Grief and affliction and ... will strike the people, and God will have mercy. The people will be disturbed</li>\n<li>regarding wealth. People will flee from one another amid the civil strife. The noblest of the kings of the earth will die.</li>\n<li>Drink will be scarce. One of the kings will be humbled. There will be high prices and flight from pla[ce]</li>\n<li>to place. There will be hunger. As for barley and frui[t], they will prosper [...]</li>\n<li>God knows best what is unseen.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
